<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Federated started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Federated started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Wayne Hood started coverage of Federated Department Stores Inc with a buy rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
